[{"id":"IU_8","ref":"8","section":"The eighteen mantras","sa":["स पर्यगाच्छुक्रमकायमव्रणमस्नाविरं शुद्धमपापविद्धम् ।","कविर्मनीषी परिभूः स्वयम्भूर्याथातथ्यतोऽर्थान् व्यदधाच्छाश्वतीभ्यः समाभ्यः ॥८॥"],"iast":["sa paryagācchukramakāyamavraṇamasnāviraṃ śuddhamapāpaviddham ।","kavirmanīṣī paribhūḥ svayambhūryāthātathyato’rthān vyadadhācchāśvatībhyaḥ samābhyaḥ ॥8॥"],"alt":[{"text":"It is He that has gone abroad—That which is bright, bodiless, without scar of imperfection, without sinews, pure, unpierced by evil. The Seer, the Thinker, the One who becomes everywhere, the Self-existent has ordered objects perfectly according to their nature from years sempiternal.","by":"Sri Aurobindo","cite":"Sri Aurobindo · CWSA 17, p. 7","source":"upanishads.org.in"}],"words":[["सः","saḥ","It is He","sa"],["पर्यगात्","paryagāt","that has gone abroad","√gā"],["शुक्रम्","śukram","bright","śukra"],["अकायम्","akāyam","bodiless","kāya"],["अव्रणम्","avraṇam","without scar of imperfection","vraṇa"],["अस्नाविरम्","asnāviram","without sinews","snāvira"],["शुद्धम्","śuddham","pure","śuddha"],["अपापविद्धम्","apāpaviddham","unpierced by evil","pāpa"],["कविः","kaviḥ","The Seer","kavi"],["मनीषी","manīṣī","the Thinker","manīṣin"],["परिभूः","paribhūḥ","the One who becomes everywhere","bhū"],["स्वयम्भूः","svayambhūḥ","the Self-existent","bhū"],["याथातथ्यतः","yāthātathyataḥ","perfectly according to their nature","yāthātathyataḥ"],["अर्थान्","arthān","objects","artha"],["व्यदधात्","vyadadhāt","has ordered","√dhā"],["समाभ्यः","samābhyaḥ","from years","samā"],["शाश्वतीभ्यः","śāśvatībhyaḥ","sempiternal","śāśvata"]],"tr":{"text":"That (Self) is all-pervading, radiant, bodiless, sore less, without sinews, pure, untainted by sin, the all-seer, the lord of the mind, transcendent and self-existent. That (Self) did allot in proper order to the eternal Prajapatis known as samvalsara (year) their duties.","by":"Vidyavachaspati V. Panoli","source":"108 Upanishads (comp. R. Sheppard)"},"audio":{"mp3":"https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/upanishaddata/SplitAudio/Isopanisad/1.8.mp3","whole":[124.95,148.03]},"hasBhashya":true,"order":9,"up":"isha"}]